r).","It spends 2.7% of revenue on R&D and 0.7% on stock compensation."],"hlth":["The balance sheet carries net cash of $124.7M (4% of market cap).","Short-term liquidity is ample (current ratio 2.10)."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at -8.1% over 3 years, 2.0% over 5 years and -2.9% over 10 years, so growth is decelerating.","At current returns, reinvesting 100% of profits supports about 7.3% a year of fundamental growth, enough to sustain growth.","Free cash flow has compounded -16.9% a year over five years, short of the 5% durability bar.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue up 50%.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (0.9x, 3.4% of sales), a maintenance pace.","Its Rule of 40 score is 11, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 1.2%, and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","Insider trading is two-way: 3 purchases and 6 sales over the past year, net $1.2M bought.","It returns 13.3% a year to shareholders (10.7% in buybacks and 2.3% in dividends).","The share count has shrunk 6.1% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","Short interest is elevated at 24.2% of the float, 10.2 days to cover."],"people":["With about 5,500 employees, each generates about $813K of revenue, 2.1x the Consumer Cyclical median.","That works out to $75K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $790K (1x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $6K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"INVEST","conv":74,"head":"Invest: trades 76% below fair value of $137; net cash of $124.7M.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 52, gates 16/25)","Trades 76% below fair value of $137","Net cash of $124.7M","Piotroski F-score 8/9","P/FCF 7.9x vs sector 16.5x"],"cons":["EV/EBITDA 2080.3x vs sector 11.2x","10 analysts' mean target $30.10 (-8%)"],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":116.67,"vc":{"base":137.26,"base_src":"dcf","bear":98.26,"bull":199.54,"alt_median":46.54,"n_alt